select public.prepify_load_bank('Computer Science', 4, $j$[["Which best describes the fundamental difference between nominal and ordinal data?",["Nominal data is numerical while ordinal data is categorical","Nominal data has no meaningful order while ordinal data has a ranking","Nominal data can be counted while ordinal data cannot","Nominal data is quantitative while ordinal data is qualitative"],"B",3,0,"1a1acf8b4fd7"],["In Big Data, which combination of V's identifies the three core characteristics?",["Volume, Value, Validity","Volume, Velocity, Variety","Volume, Veracity, Variability","Volume, Value, Volatility"],"B",1,0,"40b61ad7ace4"],["A data scientist has student grades (A, B, C, D, F), blood types (A, B, AB, O) and daily temperatures (35 °C, 28 °C, 42 °C). How are they correctly classified?",["Grades and blood types are nominal; temperatures are ordinal","Grades are ordinal; blood types are nominal; temperatures are continuous","Grades are discrete; blood types are ordinal; temperatures are continuous","All three are nominal"],"B",5,1,"248133c248df"],["Which scenario correctly illustrates the difference between primary and secondary data?",["A researcher records satellite weather data vs. analyzes data another scientist collected","A company collects its own customer feedback vs. uses government census data","A student records observations from an experiment vs. uses data from a published paper","All of the above"],"D",5,0,"c9927d370f10"],["A dataset is a collection of related records, while a system managing many such collections with relationships and controls is a database. Which option explains the difference?",["A dataset is always larger than a database","A database holds organized collections of data in multiple datasets or tables managed by a DBMS","A dataset needs a DBMS while a database does not","A database is unstructured while a dataset is structured"],"B",3,0,"ff1552498ec0"],["A company moved from separate files to a system that reduced duplication and improved data management. Which statement describes the history of databases?",["File systems were developed after databases","The first DBMS appeared in the 1960s to overcome the limits of file management systems","Non-relational databases came before relational ones","Databases were built mainly for personal computing"],"B",3,1,"a3fb8ebad5b1"],["A scientist records the number of students in a class and the temperature of a city. Which statement correctly contrasts these two kinds of data?",["Discrete data can be subdivided while continuous data cannot","Discrete data has countable values while continuous data can take any value between two points","Discrete data is always qualitative","Continuous data can only take whole numbers"],"B",3,1,"f3b789efda50"],["A social media platform must store huge amounts of unstructured posts, images and comments without fixed table structures. Which database system suits this best?",["Relational DBMS","Non-relational (NoSQL) DBMS","File management system","Data warehouse"],"B",3,1,"bceede344b6c"],["A researcher turns a large dataset into charts to discover hidden relationships, unusual values and changing patterns. What is the purpose of data visualization here?",["It can only show numbers","It only makes reports look better","It reveals patterns, trends and outliers graphically","It removes the need for any analysis"],"C",3,1,"3344e922d808"],["A company uses collection, cleaning, analysis and algorithms that learn from data automatically. How are Data Science and Machine Learning related?",["Machine Learning is a branch of Data Science that lets systems learn from data","Data Science is a small part of Machine Learning","They are unrelated fields","Machine Learning only stores data"],"A",3,1,"5bedaad48615"],["What is the correct sequence of steps in predictive analysis?",["Data collection → pattern identification → future prediction → historical analysis","Data collection → historical analysis → pattern identification → future prediction","Pattern identification → data collection → historical analysis → future prediction","Historical analysis → future prediction → data collection → pattern identification"],"B",5,0,"624bd8bdbffd"],["Which correctly describes Natural Language Processing (NLP)?",["Data visualization and predictive analytics","The interaction between human language and computers, including chatbots and sentiment analysis","Only speech recognition without text","Mathematical modelling without language understanding"],"B",3,0,"c143b711bc18"],["Which DBMS classification is correct based on how data is stored?",["Relational DBMS uses key-value pairs while NoSQL uses tables","Relational DBMS stores data in tables while NoSQL uses forms such as key-value pairs","Both store data only in tables","Relational DBMS is never used in data science"],"B",3,0,"9f906897f1f7"],["What is the correct interpretation of summary statistics?",["They only include mean and mode","They give a quick overview such as minimum, maximum, mean and standard deviation","They are only for categorical data","They replace data visualization"],"B",3,0,"37bb2ab7da7a"],["Which statement correctly distinguishes data mining from data science?",["Data mining is broader than data science","Data mining discovers patterns in existing datasets, while data science is more comprehensive","Data mining uses advanced algorithms while data science uses only basic statistics","They are identical"],"B",5,0,"32fe6b000e9a"],["Which is the correct classification of data collection methods?",["Interviews and experiments are secondary methods","Surveys and questionnaires are primary methods","Published sources are primary methods","Focus groups are secondary methods"],"B",3,0,"7aa443700271"],["Which is NOT a valid storage method for large-scale data?",["Relational databases","Distributed file systems","Manual file storage without any structure","Cloud-based storage"],"C",3,0,"73809201569b"],["What does the \"Volume\" characteristic of Big Data mean?",["The speed at which data is generated","The amount of data being processed","The variety of data types","The accuracy of data"],"B",1,0,"a0c45df9cfaa"],["A supermarket chain has five years of daily sales, customer footfall, product categories and weather data, and wants to plan what to stock each season. Which data science application fits best?",["Sentiment analysis of reviews","Demand forecasting from historical sales patterns","Social media marketing analysis","Employee performance evaluation"],"B",3,1,"c353d3363596"],["A transport company collects GPS data, traffic patterns and delivery times (in hours) for 50 trucks. What type of data are the delivery times in hours?",["Nominal","Ordinal","Continuous quantitative","Discrete qualitative"],"C",5,1,"5a609473c9eb"],["A health survey of 1000 people records age, blood pressure, disease diagnosis (yes/no), education level (primary/secondary/graduate/postgraduate) and city. Which variable is ordinal?",["Age in years","Disease diagnosis (yes/no)","Education level","City of residence"],"C",5,1,"e70969827851"],["A bank's team uses past transactions, customer profiles and known fraud cases to spot suspicious patterns in real time. Which concept is being applied?",["Natural Language Processing","Recommendation systems","Fraud detection through pattern analysis","Social media sentiment analysis"],"C",3,1,"1244db953bf7"],["During a flu outbreak, a hospital hands out questionnaires to patients and interviews healthcare workers. Which data collection method is this?",["Primary data collection","Secondary data collection","Statistical modelling","Web scraping"],"A",3,1,"baf4b5d065e0"],["A university stores Student ID, Name, Department, GPA (0.0–4.0), Enrollment year and Courses. What type of data is \"Department\"?",["Ordinal","Nominal","Discrete","Continuous"],"B",3,1,"594a8e53493b"],["A dataset holds favourite colour (red, blue...), income bracket (low, medium, high), number of siblings and daily step count. Which pair is correctly matched with its data type?",["Favourite colour – continuous; income bracket – ordinal","Favourite colour – nominal; income bracket – ordinal","Number of siblings – continuous; step count – discrete","Income bracket – nominal; step count – continuous"],"B",5,1,"3cb7786a1d5a"],["A company wants to analyze feedback from social media posts, product reviews and support calls to understand customer satisfaction. Which component suits this best?",["Predictive analytics","Natural Language Processing","Data mining","Big Data processing only"],"B",3,1,"341be1325957"],["A supermarket records \"Items purchased\" as Groceries, Electronics, Clothing, Groceries, Groceries. This variable is:",["Continuous data","Ordinal data","Nominal data","Discrete quantitative data"],"C",3,1,"18c237217733"],["An e-commerce company suggests products based on browsing history, purchases and ratings from millions of customers. Which technique is this?",["Fraud detection","Predictive maintenance","Recommendation systems","Sentiment analysis"],"C",3,1,"42d1b6518fd7"],["A research team records seismic readings every second from 200 sensors. The sensor readings represent which data collection method?",["Secondary data collection","Primary data collection through sensors","Data from published sources","Government records"],"B",3,1,"f9dfe181e663"],["A logistics company tracks the location, speed, fuel use and delivery status of 1000 vehicles in real time to optimize routes and predict delays. Which combination of applications fits best?",["Route optimization and demand forecasting only","Route optimization, real-time tracking and load balancing","Sentiment analysis and social media monitoring","Image recognition and video processing"],"B",5,1,"031f0ca01188"],["What is data?",["A collection of facts or information","A type of computer program","A mathematical equation","A graphical representation"],"A",1,0,"a596a9bd0d9d"],["What is the purpose of data analytics?",["To collect data","To analyze data and extract meaningful insights","To create hardware devices","To write computer programs"],"B",1,0,"5b87d2c9488a"],["Which of the following is an example of data?",["A computer program","Temperature readings in an experiment","A programming language","A mathematical formula"],"B",1,0,"0a78b5dd286a"],["What is data science?",["A branch of computer hardware","An interdisciplinary field that uses mathematics, statistics and machine learning to analyze data","A type of programming language","A method for creating graphical designs"],"B",1,0,"a381352dc4c7"],["Which of the following is a key component of data science?",["Data collection","Data cleaning","Data visualization","All of the above"],"D",1,0,"ffec38d45af3"],["What is the purpose of data visualization?",["To collect data","To clean data","To represent data graphically for better understanding","To write computer programs"],"C",1,0,"0fa2bb13baa5"],["Which of the following is used in data science to build predictive models?",["Data collection","Machine learning","Data cleaning","Data visualization"],"B",1,0,"fc2214173b59"],["What is the role of domain knowledge in data science?",["To write computer programs","To understand the specific field and interpret data effectively","To clean data","To collect data"],"B",1,0,"48124c345ee4"],["Which of the following is an example of qualitative data?",["Temperature readings","Survey responses about preferences","Sales numbers","Website traffic statistics"],"B",1,0,"c0fa9b48c277"],["What is the final goal of data science?",["To collect data","To clean data","To make informed decisions using insights from data","To write computer programs"],"C",1,0,"e0c4147de76e"],["What is a dataset?",["A single piece of data","A structured collection of related data","A type of machine learning algorithm","A graphical representation of data"],"B",1,0,"150f5d22343a"],["What is the purpose of statistics in data science?",["To predict future events","To analyze the frequency of past events","To create graphical representations","To clean data"],"B",1,0,"53980e65d4f4"],["Which of the following is a subset of machine learning?",["Data mining","Deep learning","Data visualization","Big Data"],"B",1,0,"ce333a118ac9"],["What is the primary focus of data mining?",["To create graphical representations","To discover patterns and relationships in datasets","To predict future events","To clean data"],"B",1,0,"fc4f9a79c4eb"],["What is Big Data?",["A type of machine learning algorithm","Handling large volumes of data","A graphical representation of data","A type of data cleaning technique"],"B",1,0,"0dc53911c4ce"],["What is predictive analysis?",["Analyzing past events","Predicting future trends based on historical data","Cleaning data","Creating graphical representations"],"B",1,0,"213b6675232c"],["What is Natural Language Processing (NLP)?",["The study of interaction between human language and computers","A type of data visualization technique","A subset of data mining","A type of machine learning algorithm"],"A",1,0,"a2aac8c3ee4b"],["Which of the following is an example of unstructured data?",["Tables","Databases","Audio files","Spreadsheets"],"C",1,0,"50ed98d2f66f"],["What is the role of mathematics in data science?",["To clean data","To solve problems and interpret complex data","To create graphical representations","To collect data"],"B",1,0,"321392eff130"],["Which of the following is an application of deep learning?",["Data cleaning","Image recognition","Data visualization","Data mining"],"B",1,0,"8364653958b4"],["Which of the following is an example of a recommendation system?",["Predicting flight delays","Suggesting movies on Netflix","Detecting credit card fraud","Analyzing customer reviews"],"B",1,0,"909f6ebf2a6c"],["What is sentiment analysis used for?",["To predict future trends","To identify customer sentiment (positive, negative or neutral)","To create graphical representations","To clean data"],"B",1,0,"f82c56e00e74"],["Which industry uses data science to optimize shipping routes?",["Healthcare","Finance","Transportation","Marketing"],"C",1,0,"3b12414e24b9"],["Which of the following is an application of data science in healthcare?",["Predicting disease outbreaks","Recommending products","Detecting credit card fraud","Creating promotional offers"],"A",1,0,"177277155100"],["What is the purpose of fraud detection in data science?",["To predict future trends","To identify unusual patterns or behaviors","To create graphical representations","To clean data"],"B",1,0,"7d06bc077086"],["Which of the following is an example of a business problem solved by data science?",["Choosing the best shipping routes","Writing computer programs","Creating hardware devices","Designing websites"],"A",1,0,"4608602d94af"],["What is the primary use of machine learning in data science?",["To clean data","To build models for automation and pattern recognition","To create graphical representations","To collect data"],"B",1,0,"b066c831b69a"],["Which of the following is an example of sentiment analysis?",["Predicting election outcomes","Analyzing customer reviews to determine satisfaction","Forecasting revenue","Detecting fraudulent transactions"],"B",1,0,"96f05fd42628"],["How does data science help in the consumer goods industry?",["By predicting stock market trends","By optimizing inventory based on demand forecasting","By creating recommendation systems","By detecting fraudulent transactions"],"B",1,0,"6dd9b01c65a6"],["What is the role of data science in logistics companies?",["To predict election outcomes","To analyze customer sentiment","To optimize delivery routes and reduce costs","To create graphical representations"],"C",1,0,"2d2818e440ef"],["Which of the following is an application of data science in e-commerce?",["Route optimization","Fraud detection","Market sentiment analysis","Quality control"],"B",1,0,"00781fc4d4ef"],["What is the primary use of data science in stock markets?",["To optimize inventory","To predict stock price movements and manage risks","To create recommendation systems","To analyze customer reviews"],"B",1,0,"1bd661883bcb"],["How does data science improve quality control in industries?",["By predicting stock market trends","By analyzing historical data to identify defects and improve processes","By creating recommendation systems","By optimizing delivery routes"],"B",1,0,"85a3cceb6da9"],["What is qualitative data?",["Data that describes objects or groups using categories","Data that deals with numeric values","Data that can be divided into smaller units","Data that represents measurements"],"A",1,0,"039f3a975b19"],["Which of the following is an example of ordinal data?",["Gender","Test grades (A, B, C)","City names","Colors"],"B",1,0,"ca89ed2a28fe"],["What is nominal data?",["Data with a specific order or ranking","Data without any order, grouped into categories","Data that can be counted","Data that represents measurements"],"B",1,0,"50d25d499aa2"],["Which of the following is an example of nominal data?",["Military ranks","Temperature","Gender","Number of students"],"C",1,0,"76c2d6dc1ab7"],["What is quantitative data?",["Data that describes objects or groups using categories","Data that deals with numeric values","Data that cannot be computed mathematically","Data that represents categories"],"B",1,0,"d5d58e2f0a1e"],["Which of the following is an example of discrete data?",["Weight","Temperature","Number of employees","Height"],"C",1,0,"df2d537a352b"],["What is continuous data?",["Data that can only take specific, countable values","Data that can take any value within a range","Data that describes categories","Data that represents rankings"],"B",1,0,"608ff4899b23"],["Which of the following is an example of continuous data?",["Number of computers","Number of tickets sold","Daily wind speed","Number of employees"],"C",1,0,"b8ae26074359"],["What is the key difference between ordinal and nominal data?",["Ordinal data has a specific order, while nominal data does not","Ordinal data is numeric, while nominal data is categorical","Ordinal data is continuous, while nominal data is discrete","Ordinal data is countable, while nominal data is not"],"A",1,0,"364f477864b0"],["Which of the following is an example of quantitative data?",["Colors","Gender","Height","City names"],"C",1,0,"bc49aa497f06"],["What is primary data?",["Data collected from existing sources","Data collected directly from original sources","Data collected from websites","Data collected from sensors"],"B",1,0,"741791a64a93"],["Which of the following is a method of collecting primary data?",["Analyzing tweets","Using seismic data","Conducting surveys","Accessing databases"],"C",1,0,"b9be90e63e0c"],["What is secondary data?",["Data collected directly from original sources","Data collected from previously recorded sources","Data collected through experiments","Data collected through observations"],"B",1,0,"2c86385965e9"],["Which of the following is an example of secondary data?",["Survey results","Interview transcripts","Tweets about a trending topic","Experimental data"],"C",1,0,"d658137190b0"],["What is the purpose of using sensors as a data source?",["To conduct surveys","To collect real-time data (e.g. seismic data)","To analyze customer preferences","To perform experiments"],"B",1,0,"9bced3067283"],["Which of the following is an example of primary data collection?",["Analyzing sales data from a company's database","Conducting interviews with employees","Collecting tweets about a political event","Using seismic data from sensors"],"B",1,0,"b11408c93055"],["What is a database?",["A single collection of data","A type of dataset","An organized collection of multiple datasets or tables","A software for data visualization"],"C",1,0,"ed27e33e5521"],["What is the role of a Database Management System (DBMS)?",["To analyze data","To collect data","To visualize data","To create, modify and retrieve data from a database"],"D",1,0,"7cf699ef1977"],["Which of the following is a relational DBMS?",["MongoDB","Cassandra","MySQL","All of the above"],"C",1,0,"d43af3c60da2"],["Which of the following is a non-relational (NoSQL) DBMS?",["Oracle","MS-Access","MongoDB","IBM Db2"],"C",1,0,"6fd88ff4c51b"],["Which of the following is an example of a dataset?",["A database with tables for customers and orders","A DBMS like MySQL","A CSV file of student grades","A NoSQL database like MongoDB"],"C",1,0,"1a0aa963a21b"],["What was used to store data before the advent of databases?",["Spreadsheets","File management systems","Cloud storage","Data warehouses"],"B",1,0,"624011640262"],["What is the primary role of databases in data science?",["To visualize data","To analyze data","To store, manage and retrieve large volumes of data","To collect data"],"C",1,0,"09c17f6498b4"],["Why have databases become popular in recent years?",["Due to the rapid increase in data generation","Due to the dependence of data science on data","Both (a) and (b)","None of the above"],"C",1,0,"3f74ff53ca5c"],["How do supermarkets use databases and data science?",["To create graphical representations of data","To manage inventory and analyze customer shopping patterns","To collect data from social media","To perform sentiment analysis"],"B",1,0,"f049667f54be"],["What is one key advantage of databases over file management systems?",["They are unstructured","They are less secure","They cannot handle large volumes of data","They provide efficient data storage and retrieval"],"D",1,0,"beee40f29f97"],["What ensures data accuracy and consistency in databases?",["Data visualization","File management systems","Constraints and validation rules","Spreadsheets"],"C",1,0,"a6f70b17450d"],["Which of the following is NOT a benefit of databases in data science?",["Efficient data storage","Data accessibility for multiple users","Data integrity","Unstructured data management"],"D",1,0,"3eadce23de5e"],["What is the first step in a statistical investigation?",["Data analysis","Data visualization","Data collection","Data interpretation"],"C",1,0,"cc4333a937e5"],["Which of the following is an example of secondary data from official records?",["Survey results","Interview transcripts","Sensor data","Government census data"],"D",1,0,"f90a26f6809d"],["What is the role of an investigator in data collection?",["To analyze data","To conduct the statistical inquiry","To visualize data","To interpret data"],"B",1,0,"828d1d50b45f"],["What are enumerators?",["People who analyze data","People who interpret data","People who assist in collecting data","People who visualize data"],"C",1,0,"3a27886ef293"],["Which of the following is a method of secondary data collection?",["Interviews","Observations","Experiments","Online databases"],"D",1,0,"e2ac4e1d4e5c"],["What is the advantage of using secondary data?",["It is always more accurate than primary data","It is easier and faster to collect","It requires direct interaction with respondents","It is always up-to-date"],"B",1,0,"dfada2e05a64"],["What is a data warehouse?",["A decentralized storage system","A type of NoSQL database","A centralized repository for integrated data","A cloud-based storage system"],"C",1,0,"5bdd920b46c5"],["Which of the following is an example of a distributed file system?",["MySQL","Hadoop Distributed File System (HDFS)","MongoDB","Blockchain"],"B",1,0,"b2c98ac912cf"],["What is cloud-based data storage?",["Storing data on physical servers","Storing data on decentralized networks","Storing data in relational databases","Storing data on remote servers accessed via the internet"],"D",1,0,"d37b7b54f7ab"],["Which of the following is a visual element used in data visualization?",["Charts","Databases","Sensors","Blockchain"],"A",1,0,"7e5920515436"],["What is summary statistics?",["A graphical representation of data","A method of storing data","A quick overview of the characteristics of a dataset","A type of database"],"C",1,0,"563410acaa28"],["Which of the following is NOT a metric in summary statistics?",["Mean","Standard deviation","Total number of values","Data visualization"],"D",1,0,"e4a20c653f67"],["What is blockchain in data storage?",["A centralized storage system","A type of relational database","A cloud-based storage system","A decentralized and secure method of storing data"],"D",1,0,"b7300c32a35f"],["What are the three Vs of Big Data?",["Volume, Velocity, Variety","Volume, Value, Variety","Velocity, Value, Volume","Variety, Value, Velocity"],"A",1,0,"c4f73704feae"],["What does \"Volume\" in Big Data refer to?",["The speed of data generation","The types of data","The amount of data","The value of data"],"C",1,0,"9617d3f2762e"],["What does \"Velocity\" in Big Data refer to?",["The amount of data","The types of data","The value of data","The speed at which data is generated and processed"],"D",1,0,"6604b61452d0"],["What does \"Variety\" in Big Data refer to?",["The amount of data","The speed of data generation","The different types and formats of data","The value of data"],"C",1,0,"ef6c6c1ebad8"],["Which of the following is an example of unstructured data found online?",["Database tables","JSON files","XML files","Social media posts"],"D",1,0,"9b0c6c69911b"],["Which of the following is an example of semi-structured data?",["Database tables","JSON files","Social media posts","Images"],"B",1,0,"e1f9eb433564"],["What is a challenge of Big Data?",["Traditional tools can easily process it","It has low volume","It requires advanced tools and technologies","It is always structured"],"C",1,0,"8f33d8d0b907"],["Which of the following is a tool used for Big Data processing?",["MySQL","Hadoop","MS-Access","Oracle"],"B",1,0,"a48e96b0bb16"],["What is an application of Big Data in healthcare?",["Customer behavior analysis","Fraud detection","Traffic optimization","Disease prediction"],"D",1,0,"cc34a42c2423"],["What is an application of Big Data in finance?",["Disease prediction","Traffic optimization","Fraud detection","Personalized marketing"],"C",1,0,"fe052e2c5ccf"],["Which of the following is NOT a characteristic of Big Data?",["Volume","Velocity","Variety","Simplicity"],"D",1,0,"2c4a06412c8f"],["What is the importance of real-time processing in Big Data?",["To handle large volumes of data","To process data at high speed","To manage different types of data","To store data securely"],"B",1,0,"0aaddb339d49"],["When did the term Big Data emerge?",["1990s","Early 2000s","2010s","1980s"],"B",1,0,"0168ad0b9d08"],["What is Hadoop?",["A social media platform","An open-source framework for storing and analyzing big datasets","A type of IoT device","A machine learning algorithm"],"B",1,0,"72f3d88a695b"],["What role does IoT play in Big Data?",["It reduces the amount of data generated","It replaces traditional data storage methods","It simplifies data analysis","It connects devices to the internet, generating more data"],"D",1,0,"015d56eed37c"],["What is the primary benefit of Big Data in product development?",["Reducing costs","Simplifying data storage","Anticipating customer demand and creating data-driven products","Eliminating the need for customer feedback"],"C",1,0,"8149f0f226ce"],["What is predictive maintenance?",["A strategy to reduce customer complaints","A proactive maintenance strategy using data analysis to predict equipment failures","A method to increase data storage capacity","A technique to improve data visualization"],"B",1,0,"85de38bc210b"],["How does Big Data improve customer experience?",["By reducing the need for customer feedback","By eliminating customer complaints","By simplifying product design","By analyzing data from social media, web visits and call logs"],"D",1,0,"1814a2e5c34e"],["What is the significance of machine learning in Big Data?",["It reduces the amount of data generated","It produces more data for analysis","It replaces traditional data storage methods","It simplifies data visualization"],"B",1,0,"482317e15f34"],["Which of the following is an example of predictive maintenance?",["Analyzing customer feedback","Simplifying product design","Reducing data storage costs","Predicting equipment failures using data analysis"],"D",1,0,"519312e1f594"],["How does Big Data enhance cybersecurity?",["By reducing the amount of data generated","By simplifying data storage","By identifying unusual patterns and anomalies to detect fraud","By eliminating the need for customer feedback"],"C",1,0,"842e7e8c8bce"],["What is a major challenge of Big Data related to data quality?",["Ensuring compatibility between tools","Poor-quality data leading to errors and inefficiency","Rapid growth of data","Data integration"],"B",1,0,"85ecfbb50e89"],["What is the challenge of data security and privacy in Big Data?",["Ensuring compatibility between tools","Rapid growth of data","Data integration","Protecting massive datasets from unauthorized access"],"D",1,0,"bd40d09b6a82"],["What is the impact of poor data quality in Big Data?",["Improved decision-making","Enhanced data security","Errors, inefficiency and misleading insights","Simplified data integration"],"C",1,0,"7b209748d272"],["What is the challenge of ensuring compatibility between Big Data tools called?",["Data quality","Data security and privacy","Data integration","Big Data tool selection"],"D",1,0,"5708e382ba4d"],["What is the challenge of harmonizing diverse data formats called?",["Data quality","Rapid growth of data","Data security and privacy","Data integration"],"D",1,0,"785568a0e9e1"],["What is the role of Big Data in media and entertainment?",["To reduce the need for content creation","To predict viewer preferences and target ads effectively","To eliminate the need for audience analysis","To simplify data visualization"],"B",1,0,"d71ac7b26442"],["How does Big Data enhance IoT capabilities?",["By reducing the amount of data generated","By eliminating the need for IoT devices","By providing meaningful insights from IoT-generated data","By simplifying data storage"],"C",1,0,"de7766343134"],["How does Big Data help governments?",[